WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:06.770
This story is one that lightly describes the ordinary daily lives of the three Minami sisters.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.360
Please don't expect too much from it.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.320
Also, watch in a bright room,

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.030
and stay 3 meters away from the TV while watching.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.370
Kana

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:22.710
Chiaki

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.500
Haruka

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:50.040
Birth of Mako-Chan

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.020
Homework...

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:07.770
What's wrong? You're looking down, Makoto.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.230
We've received so much homework!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.440
I know that.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.150
But you're so energetic when you're lamenting, Makoto.

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.360
Homework! Homework, homework, homework!

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.990
Alright! Let's help each other out and finish everything quickly!

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.870
Then let's do it at Chiaki's house.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.120
It's decided then!

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.370
Hey, hey, what's going on?

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.710
Could that be a plan to do homework together?

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:32.960
Yup!

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:37.840
That's nice. Homework must be a breeze when all three of you do it together.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.470
That's not entirely correct.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:44.720
Even if I do it by myself, it'll still be finished in no time.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.730
Well, I still take some time to play while doing it.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:53.310
Bragging about your academic ability with that sleepy look, eh?

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:58.490
Well, the three of us are pretty intelligent, after all!

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.450
Eh? What are you talking about?

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:03.490
You should belong to this side over here, right?

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.910
Throw away your pointless pride and come over here!

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.960
Welcome to the Idiot's Side!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.670
I don't want to!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.540
Don't give them any trouble!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.630
Come over here!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.340
No!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:23.220
I'm sorry! I went too far!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.970
Then Shuuichi belongs to this side.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.970
Crap! He's held captive!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:32.060
Makoto-kun, would you stop being so stubborn and just ask us to let you join our group?

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.940
Can I? If I ask you'll count me in?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.740
The whole Idiot Team?

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:39.990
Idiot Team?!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.660
I'm back.

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:47.620
Welcome back.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.540
Sorry... to intrude.

00:03:55.590 --> 00:04:00.260
Please excuse me! I never expect Chiaki to bring guys back.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.470
Go hide yourself!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.050
So, shall we begin?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.180
So that's how it is!

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:13.850
You mean with the current education system, people who do homework are idiots?

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.860
At least for those undergoing compulsory education.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.360
What are you doing?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.110
I'm explaining to him what education is about.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.320
Minami! I've awakened to the truth!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.280
Wake up, dumbass!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.030
Yes!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.500
If you're going to be a hindrance, go somewhere else.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.540
Okay. Then I won't be a bother.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:44.430
<i>When there are two dumbasses here, there's no way we can concentrate on studying.</i>

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:47.350
<i>I shouldn't have brought Makoto along...</i>

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.220
No way... Even if you ask me that all of a sudden...

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.100
I don't have any type I like...

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.150
There are three over there, right? Point her out.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.650
I'm back!

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.530
Ah, Haruka-neesama.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.570
Sorry to intrude.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.280
Ah, welcome!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:17.040
If I knew there were so many guests coming, I'd have prepared something...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.000
Are you going to prepare some simple snacks now?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.710
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.470
Then I'll help-

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.220
I'll help!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.470
Really? Thanks!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.470
Yes! I'll do my best!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.860
Like this? Haruka-san!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.110
Yup! You're good!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.700
This is fun too, Haruka-san!

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.660
You're a great help, Makoto-kun.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:53.240
It's my honor! I'll do anything as long as it's for you!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.790
Makoto-kun, you're so good with words.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.460
No, not really!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:06.300
<i>How many years do you think I have been helping Haruka?</i>

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.010
<i>I can do it best.</i>

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.100
<i>And... Just then, he called her "Haruka-san", didn't he?</i>

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.430
<i>Stop acting you know her so well!</i>

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.270
<i>There should be other ways to call her, right?</i>

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.020
Like this, Haruka-san?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.730
Yup, you're doing great!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.070
We got lots of homework!

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.610
Yup, Makoto.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:31.030
Minami! Where's your invitation for the next study meeting?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.240
There isn't one.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.990
Minami-ke!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.910
Penmanship self study

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.290
Uchida, can I have a moment?

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.380
Yes?

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.710
You see...

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.680
No point asking Uchida, I guess.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.300
Yoshino.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.720
What? You make me feel sick.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.850
Yoshino, hey.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:06:59.810
Yes?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.150
Oh, forget it. I'll ask the person herself.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.330
Minami, can I have a minute with you?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.800
I hope I'm just imagining things,

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.220
But have you been ignoring me since just now?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:35.390
I'm right! Now I'm sure of it!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.430
Why, Minami?

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.110
Chiaki.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.860
Princess!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.070
Don't call me that!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.000
The reason Chiaki hates you, eh?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.790
I have no idea at all.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.590
What do you think, Paperweight?

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.720
Who's Paperweight?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:16.720
Inkstone, my opinion is...

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.720
Who's Inkstone?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.600
She can't put up with Writing Brush's stupidity anymore.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.020
Writing Brush.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.860
I see! So I'm Writing Brush, eh?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.990
Ah, Chiaki has started to test the ink.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:40.290
Perhaps her present state of mind will show in her writing.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.160
Perhaps you might even get a hint as to why she hates you.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.330
I see!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.720
<b>Dumbass</b>

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:55.970
That's...

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.470
It's her hate itself!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.020
She's nodding.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.680
She's satisfied with its quality?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.770
Looking from the reverse side, it looks like it was written briskly.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.980
Perhaps it would better if you apologized?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.780
She looks really mad.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.910
Minami!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.490
This! Please read it!

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:23.080
I'm Sorry

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.160
Zero points.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:27.080
Eh?! Zero points?!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.880
It can't be!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:33.090
When people are concentrating on dipping the brush in the ink, don't talk to them.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.840
Don't take calligraphy so lightly.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.510
Eh? That's why you were ignoring me?

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:40.720
And this is a work of heart and soul.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.100
The "dumb" part looks good, doesn't it?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:46.560
That... That's true. You're a master at calligraphy, Minami.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.190
That's the Princess for you!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:53.900
Don't ever call me that again!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.450
Yoshino, Uchida.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.950
Minami is ignoring me.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.250
What do you think about Broom?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.080
It's Broom's fault.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.550
Minami-ke!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.760
It's amnesia.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.510
That can't be! Ninomiya-kun!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.390
It's my fault...

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:31.310
Even though I'm a teacher, I still fell in love with Ninomiya-kun.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.690
Oh no! Ninomiya-san is gone!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.490
Mister, you've had too much.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.070
It's about time you get going...

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.410
None of your business!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.750
Bastard! What the fuck do you think you're doing?!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.290
Don't ever come back!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:03.600
That is...

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:05.760
Ninomiya-kun!

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:10.230
Ninomiya-kuuuuun!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.110
Oh my, a blackout?

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:18.190
Damnit! And we were just getting to the good part!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.610
Haruka-neesama.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.160
Request a re-broadcast from the television station.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.120
Call the electric company and file a protest.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:35.040
Technique

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.010
So yeah...

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:41.720
Chiaki didn't invite Makoto-kun to her house, so he's depressed.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.850
Makoto-kun is that stupid kid, right?

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.890
He looks like the type that Chiaki would hate.

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:49.390
I'm back.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.060
And I bought drinks.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.690
Welcome back!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.860
Alright Uchida, next time bring him along.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.700
I'll make things more interesting.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.490
Now that's worrying.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.990
24 Hours Later

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.500
I know the reason you want to come to our house.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.630
No, it's not that I want to see Haruka-san, nothing wicked like that!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.800
I understand, you don't need to say anything more.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.760
But you said Chiaki didn't invite you.

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.260
Yeah. For some reason she doesn't want to invite me...

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.220
In that case it's simple.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.690
Just come as my friend.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.020
But...

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.150
Disguise yourself.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.320
Uchida, let's begin.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.400
Okay!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.860
Wait a second!

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:46.820
If Minami... If Chiaki sees me she'll find out!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.030
Don't worry!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:52.290
The reason Chiaki's eyes are always half-open,

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.290
Is so that she doesn't see anything that she doesn't want to.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.920
Perhaps she hasn't seen your face before.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.920
So let's make your hairstyle cuter first.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:06.390
I can't go with a cute hairstyle!

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:07.970
You see, I'm...

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.470
Dripping with wildness!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.020
It will suit you.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.390
Eh? Really?

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:17.150
By the way, the clothes are what I used to wear.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.690
I can't wear women's clothes!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.230
Look, I'm...

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.740
Born with this dandyism!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.110
It suits you.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.780
Eh? Really?

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.950
It's about time Haruka and Chiaki come back.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:37.710
In order to make this plan succeed, I want everyone to give it their all.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.040
Are you mentally prepared?

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.130
30 Minutes Later

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.890
I'm back.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.560
This is my junior. Her name is Mako-chan.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.770
Doesn't that name sound fishy?

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.780
Chiaki Vision

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.000
Uchida

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:20.380
Stupidity Reading
Uchida

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.380
Kana
Stupidity Reading
Uchida

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:27.220
Stupidity Reading

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:29.760
Mako-chan

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:30.760
Friend of Kana
Mako-chan

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.260
Stupidity Reading

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.180
<b>Insufficient Data
Stupidity Reading
Friend of Kana
Mako-chan</b>

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.560
Hello.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.680
She's showing manners!

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.190
Not really.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.110
10 Minutes Later

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.110
I'm back.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.780
Oh my, it's someone I haven't seen before.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.320
My junior, Mako-chan.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.570
Hello.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.740
Yes, hello.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.600
How long will you be staying here?

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:19.810
How about joining us for dinner?

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.770
Hey, Haruka!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:25.150
Even if it's all women here, you shouldn't just take off your clothes like that.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.650
That's uncouth!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:28.280
Ah, excuse me.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:32.490
And what's with that over-relaxed way of stripping?

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.910
You're unbelievable!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:39.460
Oh my!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.330
Kana-chan!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:48.010
Mako-chan's face is changing colors like a traffic light!

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.920
What kind of technique was used on her to make her become like this?

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.140
Technique.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.020
Minami-ke!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.530
I... I'll pretend I didn't see anything.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.580
Wait! What's with that reaction!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.670
It's as if I'm doing something shameful!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.210
It's a misunderstanding!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.010
I'm doing this because I like...

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.510
So you do like this.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.590
Listen to what I have to say!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.760
The clothing is not what I like!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.220
I don't want to!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.180
I like Haruka-san!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.350
Nooo!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.570
I'm sorry! I went too far!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.240
I see!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.620
You want to become Mako-chan again.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.580
In order to lay traps for Haruka-chan and the others.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.460
Wh-What's with that slanderous...

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:08.460
I simply, and sincerely, just want to go to Minami's house!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.090
For that, I have no other way but to become Mako-chan!

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.510
How about borrowing clothes from Kana-chan again?

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.390
You are right!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:21.770
But you'll look suspicious if you keep wearing Kana-chan's clothes.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:26.730
Looks like I have no choice but to buy my own!

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.190
Wait a minute!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:32.150
A guy buying women's clothes is weird, isn't it?

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.620
Thanks, Uchida!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.040
This way, I won't look strange buying women's clothes!

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:48.380
Yup! It's fortunate that my house is near this place!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.750
Alright! Time to buy it!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.130
Hey Uchida.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:59.340
How about lending this set of clothes to me from now on?

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.510
That's a no.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:35.170
Do I really have to wear this?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.260
Hello.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.260
Ah! Haruka-chan?!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.640
Oh my!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:51.270
Erm... you're the girl who came to our house last time...

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.400
I'm Mako-chan!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:55.900
Yes, that's right! Mako-chan!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:56.860
Eh?

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.240
Shopping?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:04.580
Y-Yes. But it's my first time buying this...

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:08.000
I see... it's your first time.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.500
In that case I'll help you.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:19.930
Uh... Erm...

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:22.140
You don't need to feel nervous.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.930
I'll choose something that fits you.

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:29.230
The first time usually doesn't go well.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:31.690
First I'll have to measure your size.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.360
Can you take off your clothes?

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.780
<i>I can't take off my clothes!</i>

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.360
<i>You see, I...</i>

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:42.160
<i>Have this manly chest!</i>

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.950
Okay, I'm going to measure you.

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:47.410
Yes!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.670
Eh?

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.180
<i>She's... Going to find out...</i>

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.800
As I suspected...

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.600
Mako-chan...

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.600
You...

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.570
<i>She found me out, eh?</i>

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.360
Perhaps it's a bit too early to wear one.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:25.530
Don't worry! They'll become bigger in no time.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.950
When that time comes, let's buy it then.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:28.990
Okay?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.750
Yes...

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.000
Okay, see you!

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.010
You weren't exposed, Mako-chan?

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:44.680
Mako-chan?!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:50.850
Mako-chan's face is changing colors like a traffic light again!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:55.190
Another killing... technique...

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.030
I'm back!

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.240
Welcome back, Haruka-neesama.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.910
You were taking a bath?

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.200
Yes, I sweat a lot during today's physical education lesson.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.830
Chiaki...

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:18.250
I thought it was your sideburns, but it turned out to be hair from your ear.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.550
Wait, Chiaki.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:26.970
Yes?

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.150
Wh-what's wrong?

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.110
I guess you're still fine.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:49.240
Well then, today's dinner will be...

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.410
Haruka-neesama?

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:54.620
I'm telling you, Chiaki! You need to cut your ear hair...

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:31.130
Next Episode

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:33.300
Mako-chan is cute, isn't she?

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:36.100
I can't believe she's a junior of that dumbass.

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.520
Next time, "Many Faces".

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:38.560
But didn't she look a bit like Makoto-kun?

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:41.020
Many Faces
But didn't she look a bit like Makoto-kun?

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:43.100
That being rude to Mako-chan.
Many Faces

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.480
Oh my, oh my.
Many Faces

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:45.020
Many Faces
